{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_25_1463836094#9_2825253470","relevance":3,"reason":"The document section is about bee/wasp sting allergy management and directly states that venom immunotherapy reduces serious allergic reactions to insect stings and improves quality of life.","learned":"For patients with systemic Hymenoptera sting reactions, venom immunotherapy improves quality of life and is effective for many wasp- and bee-venom allergic patients."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1046","reason":"This query is yielding high-quality direct evidence on bee/Hymenoptera stings and quality of life, so continue retrieving more results."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1046"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_56_778278917#16_1605639199","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1046","rank":3,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_56_778278917#16_1605639199\" , \"end_char\": 4285.000000 , \"headings\": \" Bee, yellow jacket, wasp, and other Hymenoptera stings: Reaction types and acute management Author: Section Editor: Deputy Editor: INTRODUCTION OVERVIEW To continue reading this article, you must log in with your personal, hospital, or group practice subscription. REFERENCES \" , \"segment\": \"N Engl J Med 2004; 351:1978. Bilò MB, Martini M, Pravettoni V, et al. Large local reactions to <cover>Hymenoptera stings: Outcome of re-stings in real life. Allergy 2019; 74:1969. Oude Elberink JN, De Monchy JG, Van Der Heide S, et al. Venom immunotherapy improves health-related quality of life </cover>in patients allergic to yellow jacket venom. J Allergy Clin Immunol 2002;\" , \"start_char\": 3923.000000 , \"title\": \"Bee, yellow jacket, wasp, and other Hymenoptera stings: Reaction types and acute management - UpToDate\" , \"url\": \"https://www.uptodate.com/contents/bee-yellow-jacket-wasp-and-other-hymenoptera-stings-reaction-types-and-acute-management\" }"}}
