{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_56_778278917#16_1605639199","relevance":2,"reason":"The UpToDate page is dedicated to Hymenoptera stings and includes a citation stating venom immunotherapy improves health-related quality of life in venom-allergic patients, but the visible evidence is only in the references rather than a substantive answer passage.","learned":"A cited study reports that venom immunotherapy improves health-related quality of life in patients allergic to yellow jacket venom."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1046","reason":"The query is still returning closely related Hymenoptera sting quality-of-life evidence, so continue to look for additional direct grade-3 sources."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1046"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_25_1463836094#8_2825251705","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1046","rank":4,"snippet":"often positive than serum-specific IgE and correlate better with history. Baseline tryptase should be measured. Those with raised levels have a higher risk of severe systemic reactions. Treatment of patients with bee or wasp sting allergy All patients with a history of systemic reaction should be immediately provided with a written emergency management plan, an adrenaline (epinephrine) auto-injector and education in its use. With children, appropriate liaison with the school is recommended. Venom immunotherapy (VIT) is recommended for all patients with a severe systemic reaction after a sting. It reduces the chances of a serious <cover>allergic reaction to an insect sting and improves quality of life. VIT is the only specific treatment that is currently available for patients with a history of systemic reaction to a Hymenoptera </cover>insect sting. VIT is effective in 95% of patients allergic to wasp venom and about 80% of those allergic to bee venom. VIT is not often recommended for children.\" , \"start_char\": 4702.000000 , \"title\": \"Insect Bites and Stings Treatment Information | Patient\" , \"url\": \"https://patient.info/doctor/insect-bites-and-stings-pro\" }"}}
