{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_05_1004088852#7_1823900839","relevance":3,"reason":"The DermNet bee and wasp stings page directly answers the question by listing impact on quality of life as a complication: anxiety resulting in social restriction after bee/wasp stings.","learned":"Bee and wasp stings can affect quality of life by causing anxiety that leads to social restriction; severe reactions may also include anaphylaxis and other complications."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1052","reason":"This query is specifically finding direct evidence on anxiety, social restriction, and quality-of-life impact from bee/Hymenoptera stings, so continue for more grade-3 documents."}}
