{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"allergy shots\" \"bee sting\" \"quality of life\")"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_28_1612021813#0_3269334906","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1062","rank":3,"snippet":"disease in children and adults. Our physicians practice up-to-date evidence-based medicine, and incorporate the latest innovations in our field. We truly care about our patients and provide tailored and personalized medical care. Our practice offers a wide range of services with innovative treatments for food allergies, seasonal allergies, pet allergies, asthma, nasal polyps, <cover>bee sting/venom allergies, hives/angioedema, eczema, and multiple other conditions. We would love to have the opportunity to improve your quality of life. Please call or schedule online to make an appointment. Patient quick links: Patient Portal Request an Appointment Pay My Bill Our Services and Treatments Food Allergies We diagnose and treat food allergies including milk/dairy, eggs, peanut, tree nuts, fish, shellfish and others. Learn More Stinging Insects We offer venom immunotherapy to reduce the severity of allergic reactions to stinging insects/venom. Learn More Seasonal Allergies We offer treatments to alleviate seasonal allergies including allergen immunotherapy  (allergy shots).</cover>\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"St. Paul Allergy and Asthma – Diplomats of the American Board of Allergy & Immunology\" , \"url\": \"https://stpaulallergy.com/\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_56_1391180600#12_2762248206","rank":1,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_56_1391180600#11_2762246097","rank":2,"relevance":3}]}}
