{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"insect stings\" \"quality of life\" \"venom immunotherapy\")"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_32_852782448#9_1642184102","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1088","rank":1,"snippet":"careful supervision of experienced physicians. In addition to diagnosing and treating asthma and seasonal allergy symptoms, the Advanced Allergy & Asthma medical staff can address a variety of respiratory conditions, including chronic cough and sinusitis, as well as eczema and allergies triggered by <cover>insect stings, foods, and medications. The team uses the latest advancements in immunotherapy to reduce patient sensitivity to a variety of environmental triggers. If you’re looking for comprehensive allergy and asthma care for you or your family, schedule a consultation at Advanced Allergy & Asthma today by phone or by using the online booking feature. What we offer Services Allergies Food Allergies Eczema Hives Asthma Insect Allergy (Venom Immunotherapy) Rush Therapy Allergy Shots Drug Desensitization Penicillin Skin Testing Insect Allergies Spirometry Cough Rash Peanut Allergies Chronic Sinus Mission Statement To deliver cutting edge and personalized medical care for the treatment of allergic and immunologic diseases to help our patients reclaim and maintain their quality of life</cover>Check out the daily pollen count View Providers Vicki J. Lyons, MD PC Dr. Lyons has been practicing in Ogden, Utah for more than 18 years and currently is Section Leader of the Department of Allergy and Immunology at McKay Dee Hospital. "}}
