{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"insect sting\" \"venom immunotherapy\" (+ fear anxiety \"quality of life\"))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_00_71959995#0_133914980","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1109","rank":3,"snippet":"1485.000000 , \"headings\": \"Insect Sting Allergy Insect Sting Allergy Overview Insect Sting Allergy Symptoms Insect Sting Allergy Management and Treatment Symptoms Diagnosing Management and Treatment<cover>Venom Immunotherapy Avoiding Insect Stings Fire Ant Sting Fire ant sting allergy treatment What is a normal reaction to a fire ant sting, and how is it treated? FAQs What should I do if a bee stings me, and when should I see an allergist? How do I know if I’ve had an allergic reaction to an insect sting? Who is affected by allergies to insect stings? Can I get rid of my insect sting allergy? Do I need to have an epinephrine auto-injector? What is whole body extract immunotherapy? \" , \"segment\": \"Insect Sting Allergies | Symptoms & Treatment | ACAAI Public Website Insect Sting Allergy You are here Home » Allergies » Types of Allergies: Overview Symptoms Diagnosing Management and Treatment Fire Ant Sting FAQs Overview Overview It’s more common to fear </cover>an insect sting than to actually be allergic to one. An allergist is an expert who can explain the difference between an allergic reaction and a normal reaction, thus reducing anxiety and ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_25_1463836094#8_2825251705","rank":1,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_25_1463836094#9_2825253470","rank":2,"relevance":3}]}}
