{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_10_693948946#3_1288970165","relevance":1,"reason":"This WebMD Bee Venom page discusses live bee stings as a treatment for multiple sclerosis and says they did not improve fatigue, disability, or quality of life, but it does not address how bee stings or bee-sting allergy affect quality of life.","learned":"Bee venom therapy pages are mostly off-target because their quality-of-life statements concern unrelated therapeutic uses such as MS."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"venom allergy\" (+ anxiety fear) (+ immunotherapy stings bee wasp hymenoptera))","reason":"Search for sources on venom allergy that discuss anxiety/fear and immunotherapy without requiring the exact quality-of-life phrase, aiming to find direct evidence on the psychological burden of bee/wasp sting allergy and treatment benefits."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"venom allergy\" (+ anxiety fear) (+ immunotherapy stings bee wasp hymenoptera))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_07_571733127#11_990044617","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1122","rank":1,"snippet":"Tight Throat Feels Tight Causes and Treatments for Throat Tightness 1. Anxiety 2. Thyroid Problems 3. Acid Reflux 4. Food Allergy 5. Medication Allergy 6. Insect Venom Allergy When to See a Doctor \" , \"segment\": \"Your healthcare provider may prescribe an EpiPen for severe reactions. If you develop severe throat tightness or shortness of breath, call for medical assistance. 6. Insect Venom Allergy Most people do not react to an insect bite or sting; however, some people have a true allergy to the venom injected when an insect bites or <cover>stings. Throat tightness after an insect sting is a true medical emergency. You may notice swelling or itching in your throat followed by shortness of breath, anxiety and confusion. Treatment for insect venom allergy </cover>includes avoiding the insects. If you are stung, remove the stinger. Keep the area of the sting below the level of your heart if possible.\" , \"start_char\": 4966.000000 , \"title\": \"Causes and Treatments of Tight Feelings in Throat | Just-Health.net\" , \"url\": \"http://www.just-health.net/Throat-Feels-Tight.html\" }"}}
